            <content:encoded>
                <![CDATA[
                    
                    <p><a class="s_tag" href="https://www.ithome.com/" target="_blank">IT之家</a> 9 月 24 日消息，Logitech G（罗技 G）现已在电商平台销售今日推出的 PRO X3 LIGHTSPEED 无线 7.1 游戏耳机，<strong>到手价 1,699 元</strong>。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="461" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/4827b04d-af7e-4088-96b3-b66f4faae36b.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_461" title="罗技 G PRO X3 LIGHTSPEED 头戴式游戏耳麦发售，到手价 1699 元" width="1040" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=vmUUqoVPJ2ulhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWgpcJRl3wFwcV%2FlEyhmp8CHA4WZW5OsT%2FUcTKgnplIKPHXk%2BvKLZvOz%2FsYsc2VHLOEL5jqibr6aWTPvHrf0SfF7hIh1FhZHBvIxbd4gBYpFrot4aGAlj7%2FGtY6bnjaIXeKY7bt%2FJxei9bLAy%2F71%2BNvTrmYNz1Ii0vjFMM8WJUihQ8vXcFOWh%2FVRhTyMApKzFUVeqfmHymCWmTVZ8J%2FhSVYo3XwCjH%2BLOyUgwIt9KkNqA4Rf0CerVU%2BLogmiWU%2Bx65fEpcZ82j7dl%2FNxnx7dr2DsLNH%2FkatfaKp75K7%2FyOr4JTNWSR3CwiY%3D&amp;traceId=213e050317902625189672677e0af6&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1790262519@213def39_14c3_1a0d3f62509_a151@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img.alicdn.com/bao/uploaded/i4/2200877014436/O1CN01VhjdCmLBfcB1chua_!!4611686018427387300-0-item_pic.jpg" title="罗技 G PRO X3 LIGHTSPEED 头戴式游戏耳麦发售，到手价 1699 元" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name">罗技 G PRO X3 LIGHTSPEED 游戏耳麦</span></span><span class="card-abstract"></span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price"> 1699 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p>这款耳机<strong>基于 50mm 石墨烯驱动单元 PRO-G GRAPHENE</strong>，配套<strong>可插拔 16bit / 48kHz 全带宽全向麦克风</strong>，提供 70hr 无线电池续航，支持 10 段 EQ 调节，拥有打孔人造革头带、配有人造革或丝绒材质的可旋转记忆棉耳罩。</p><p>该耳机驱动单元频率响应范围 20~20000Hz，阻抗 38Ω，灵敏度 87.8 dB @ 1mW / 1cm；麦克风频率响应范围 75~20000Hz；支持三模连接。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="461" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/13a992ed-6b64-43e9-b6e